263
00:22:23.414 --> 00:22:24.748
It's messy.

264
00:22:26.851 --> 00:22:28.786
Sometimes it's as if I...

265
00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:31.355
As if you should never
have been born,

266
00:22:31.521 --> 00:22:32.588
- right?
- Yeah.

267
00:22:32.590 --> 00:22:33.756
